PROJECT: Cardano

Event ID

EV-001

Date

2015

Event Name

Pendirian Input Output Hong Kong (IOHK/IOG) dan Dimulainya Penelitian Cardano

Event Type

Founding

Description

Charles Hoskinson dan Jeremy Wood mendirikan IOHK (kini IOG) di Hong Kong untuk mengembangkan platform blockchain generasi ketiga berbasis penelitian akademis dan formal verification. Penelitian awal konsensus Proof-of-Stake Ouroboros dimulai.

Participants

Input Output Global (IOG), Charles Hoskinson, Jeremy Wood

Location

Hong Kong

Status

Completed

Immediate Result

Entitas pengembang inti Cardano terbentuk; program penelitian protokol Ouroboros diluncurkan.

Sources

https://inputoutput.io/en/blog/posts/2015/10/02/input-output-hong-kong-announces-new-cryptocurrency-project/

